              <li style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:0.5rem;"><svg style="width:14px;height:14px;fill:var(--accent-green);" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z"/></svg> <strong>1 Free Masterclass</strong> Enrollment</li>
              <li style="display:flex; align-items:center; gap:0.5rem;"><svg style="width:14px;height:14px;fill:var(--accent-green);" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M9 16.17L4.83 12l-1.42 1.41L9 19 21 7l-1.41-1.41z"/></svg> Complimentary Grocery Service</li>
