        <div>
          <h1 class="section-title"><svg class="svg-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M12 3L1 9l4 2.18v6L12 21l7-3.82v-6l2-1.09V17h2V9L12 3zm6.82 6L12 12.72 5.18 9 12 5.28 18.82 9zM17 15.99l-5 2.73-5-2.73v-3.72l5 2.73 5-2.73v3.72z"/></svg> Course Enrollment</h1>
          <p class="section-subtitle">Enroll in professional culinary courses taught by our verified expert chefs.</p>
        </div>
        <a href="/courses" target="_blank" class="btn-outline" style="font-size:0.82rem; padding:0.45rem 1rem; display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:0.4rem;">
          <span>View Full Course Catalog</span>
          <svg style="width:14px;height:14px;fill:currentColor;" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path d="M19 19H5V5h7V3H5c-1.11 0-2 .9-2 2v14c0 1.1.89 2 2 2h14c1.1 0 2-.9 2-2v-7h-2v7zM14 3v2h3.59l-9.83 9.83 1.41 1.41L19 6.41V10h2V3h-7z"/></svg>
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Main Course Enrollment Card -->
