            <div style="flex:1; height:1px; background:#e0ead0;"></div>
            <span style="font-size:0.72rem; font-weight:700; color:#2C5F2D; text-transform:uppercase; letter-spacing:0.8px; background:#f0f7f0; padding:0.2rem 0.6rem; border-radius:8px; border:1px solid #d4e7d4;">Standardized per 100g Portion</span>
            <div style="flex:1; height:1px; background:#e0ead0;"></div>
